# ── A PATH of the BetterCommunity domain → another app (e.g. example.com__PATH__/) ──────────
#
# This file is imported INSIDE the BetterCommunity site block, so it holds directives, not a
# site block.
#
# DNS    nothing: the name is the site's own, and so is its certificate.
#
# READ BEFORE CHOOSING THIS OVER A SUB-DOMAIN. An app on a path shares the site's ORIGIN:
#   - its JavaScript runs with the same origin as BetterCommunity, so it can call /api with
#     the visitor's session. A flaw in that app is a flaw in BetterCommunity.
#   - it inherits the site's headers, the Content-Security-Policy included: an app that loads
#     scripts from another host will be refused by the browser.
#   - the app must be built for a base path (every link and asset under __PATH__/). An app
#     that links to `/style.css` fetches BetterCommunity's `/style.css` instead.
# A sub-domain (templates/service.caddy or host.caddy) has none of these problems.
#
# How it works: `vars` marks the prefix so the site's trailing-slash rule leaves it alone
# (otherwise `__PATH__/` → `__PATH__` → `__PATH__/` loops), the bare `__PATH__` is sent to
# `__PATH__/`, and `handle_path` strips the prefix, so the app sees `/` for `__PATH__/`.
#
#! Template only — lines starting with "#!" are dropped from the file site.mjs writes.
#! Placeholders: __NAME__ __PATH__ __UPSTREAM__. The CLI fills them:
#!   node infra/caddy/site.mjs add path --path __PATH__ --to __UPSTREAM__
#! By hand: copy this file to paths.d/<name>.caddy, replace every placeholder, then run
#!   node infra/caddy/site.mjs apply

@bc_mount___NAME__ path __PATH__ __PATH__/*
vars @bc_mount___NAME__ bc_mount yes
redir __PATH__ __PATH__/ 308
handle_path __PATH__/* {
	reverse_proxy __UPSTREAM__ {
		# The app learns where it is mounted from this header, if it reads it.
		header_up X-Forwarded-Prefix __PATH__
		# Same origin, so the browser sends the session cookie here too. The app has no use
		# for it; it is removed before the request leaves Caddy.
		header_up Cookie "(^|;\s*)(bcw_session|bcw_elevated|tele_session)=[^;]*" ""
	}
}
